Copyright 2026 OpenCode Plugin Contributors

This project is a tribute to and inspired by codex-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc) by OpenAI.

The architecture, plugin structure, and command patterns are derived from the
original codex-plugin-cc project, adapted to work with OpenCode
(https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode) instead of Codex.

This fork (https://github.com/CTroncoso11/opencode-plugin-cc) is maintained by
Cristian Troncoso and contains modifications to armedi/opencode-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/armedi/opencode-plugin-cc), itself based on
tasict/opencode-plugin-cc (https://github.com/tasict/opencode-plugin-cc).
